# Modified from the upstream OpenTelemetry Demo release 2.2.0.
# Change: paths retargeted from src/ to services/, and entries for directories this
# repository does not carry were dropped.
#
# This file governs the whole build, because every container definition here builds from
# the repository root. A per-service context cannot be used: seven components copy from the
# shared contract at pb/, which sits outside any single service directory.
#
# Container definitions are excluded from the context deliberately. Docker reads the
# Dockerfile through -f rather than from the context, so excluding them keeps an edit to
# one service's definition from invalidating cached layers for every other service.

services/*/README.md
services/*/Dockerfile
services/*/*/Dockerfile
services/*/Dockerfile.cypress

# currency
./services/currency/client.js
./services/currency/node_modules/

# frontend
./services/frontend/node_modules/

# shipping
./services/shipping/target
